		<Placemark id="09D5126CE336B59D5BD6">
			<name>the retreat from Mons</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div>The 1st Battalion Hampshire Regiment arrive at&nbsp;Le Havre on the 24th August. The following day they travel by train to Le Cateau - and pitch straight into the Retreat from Mons.<br></div>]]></description>
